   276	
   277	- MEDIUM：H4 多候选路径未经 Markdown 安全转义。[render_md:1438-1447](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-v6-inbox/canvas-vault/.claude/skills/clear-inbox/scripts/inbox_preview.py:1438) 对 `A/甲\`一.md`、`B/乙\`二.md` 输出的 raw MD 虽完整，但 CommonMark 实际渲染为：
