## 二、新回归

### BLOCKER-1：CJK 邻接 AI 绕过 fail-closed 护栏

- 位置：[inbox_preview.py:665-670](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-v6-inbox/canvas-vault/.claude/skills/clear-inbox/scripts/inbox_preview.py:665)、[903-912](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-v6-inbox/canvas-vault/.claude/skills/clear-inbox/scripts/inbox_preview.py:903)、[1043-1074](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-v6-inbox/canvas-vault/.claude/skills/clear-inbox/scripts/inbox_preview.py:1043)。
- 根因：`\bAI\b` 在 `由AI系统` 中没有 Unicode 词边界，有限标记表又没有 `由AI系统生成`。
- 输入：

```yaml
---
generator: 本报告由AI系统生成
---
```

- 真实 CLI：

```sh
python3 -B /private/tmp/card-g56b-root.j8tjIQ/tree/canvas-vault/.claude/skills/clear-inbox/scripts/inbox_preview.py --vault /private/tmp/card-g56b-root.j8tjIQ/reg/NEW/vault --now 2026-09-01T00:00:00+08:00 --out-dir /private/tmp/card-g56b-root.j8tjIQ/reg/NEW/out
```

- 实际输出：

```json
{"name":"CJK邻接AI.md","criterion":"C3_empty_or_skeleton","verdict":"建议删","basis":"剥离 frontmatter / HTML 注释后实质正文 0 字符（46 字节文件：标题 0 行、纯结构行 0 行、代码围栏 0 行、其余皆空行或注释）","confident":true,"uncertain_reason":null}
```

这不是语义否定或话题提及，而是肯定式生成声明，并且实际产生删除提名，故不属于题目豁免的原理上限。

### BLOCKER-2：tab/NBSP 缩进正文被误当 ATX 标题剥除

- 位置：[inbox_preview.py:335](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-v6-inbox/canvas-vault/.claude/skills/clear-inbox/scripts/inbox_preview.py:335)、[596-618](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-v6-inbox/canvas-vault/.claude/skills/clear-inbox/scripts/inbox_preview.py:596)。
- 根因：`_HEADING_RE = r"^\s{0,3}..."` 把 tab 和 NBSP 都当成一个合法标题缩进字符。tab 形态按项目自己的 CommonMark 口径是缩进代码，NBSP 形态是普通正文。
- 输入字节：

```text
TAB:  09 23 20 6b 65 65 70 0a
NBSP: c2 a0 23 20 6b 65 65 70 0a
```

- 同一真实 CLI 实际输出：

```json
{"name":"tab缩进标题.md","criterion":"C3_empty_or_skeleton","verdict":"建议删","basis":"剥离 frontmatter / HTML 注释后实质正文 0 字符（8 字节文件：标题 1 行、纯结构行 0 行、代码围栏 0 行、其余皆空行或注释）","confident":true}
{"name":"NBSP缩进标题.md","criterion":"C3_empty_or_skeleton","verdict":"建议删","basis":"剥离 frontmatter / HTML 注释后实质正文 0 字符（9 字节文件：标题 1 行、纯结构行 0 行、代码围栏 0 行、其余皆空行或注释）","confident":true}
```

diff 未显示 `_HEADING_RE` 本身由本轮修改，故不能证明是“整改引入”；但它是当前终态存在的删除 BLOCKER。

### BLOCKER-3：来源护栏只识别前缀，合法包装形态穿透

- 位置：frontmatter 值处理 [inbox_preview.py:478-493](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-v6-inbox/canvas-vault/.claude/skills/clear-inbox/scripts/inbox_preview.py:478)，URL 信号仅剥 `<…>` 后检查前缀 [989-1005](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-v6-inbox/canvas-vault/.claude/skills/clear-inbox/scripts/inbox_preview.py:989)。
- 输入：

```yaml
---
URL: !!str https://example.test/x
---
```

- 实际输出：

```json
{"name":"YAML标签URL.md","criterion":"C3_empty_or_skeleton","verdict":"建议删","basis":"剥离 frontmatter / HTML 注释后实质正文 0 字符（42 字节文件：标题 0 行、纯结构行 0 行、代码围栏 0 行、其余皆空行或注释）","confident":true,"uncertain_reason":null}
```

有效 YAML 的带引号 Markdown 链接值也可达：

```yaml
URL: "[来源](https://example.test/x)"
```

```json
{"name":"Markdown链接URL有效YAML.md","criterion":"C3_empty_or_skeleton","verdict":"建议删","confident":true,"uncertain_reason":null}
```

这是来源信息被静默忽略后产生的删除提名，故记 BLOCKER。

### 重点正向对照

- H2：`> 本文由 Deep Research 生成` → C2、`deep research 报告/`；`R99_深度调研.md` 内 `由 AI 生成` → C2、`R99/`。
- H2 ASCII 分档：`Generated by AI Lab researchers` 与 `Generated by AI on March` 均为 `C6 / confident=false / target=null`；后者是安全漏判。
- H3：`tags:`、时间戳、带引号值、tab 分隔、`title : x` 均保持解析；quoted/tab/spaced source 均进 C1。
- H1：IPv6、大写 scheme、Unicode IDN 均进 `C1 / 留原地 / primary-record`。
- C3 护栏：坏 source、未解析 frontmatter、未闭合注释均为 `C6 / 拿不准 / confident=false / target/type=null`，理由如实；纯骨架与闭合注释骨架仍为 C3。
- H4：三候选测试也完整列出全部路径并声明不可判。

